Daddy.

161
00:12:24,300 --> 00:12:26,520
Daddy. Daddy.

162
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,790
Daddy!

163
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,400
You're back.

164
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,562
It's a miracle.

165
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:50,160
So, do you know where you are
or what's going on? Uh-uh.

166
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:53,420
Oh, well, we're not in SAO anymore.

167
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:56,115
We're in a totally different game now.

168
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,108
It's called Alfheim Online.

169
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,200
I need a few seconds to assess it.

170
00:13:03,020 --> 00:13:08,160
From what I can tell, this world has been
copied from the Sword Art Online servers.

171
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:10,320
Really? Yes.

172
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:15,340
The engine, programming, and
graphics format are exactly the same.

173
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:20,721
The Cardinal system needs updating, but
that's the only thing that sticks out to me.

174
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,310
Huh.

175
00:13:22,393 --> 00:13:25,217
That makes sense, because Argus
was the company running SAO.

176
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:27,182
They folded and Wreck took over.

177
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,550
Yeah,

178
00:13:28,633 --> 00:13:33,025
