technology, it figures they ported over.

179
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:37,840
Although, when I checked I still had
my old skills and stats. Strange.

180
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:41,181
I'll take a look at your
data and see what I find.

181
00:13:43,180 --> 00:13:44,300
Very interesting.

182
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:45,710
You're right.

183
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:49,587
This is the same character data
you used when you were in SAO.

184
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,641
The formatting for saved
data is almost identical.

185
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:58,161
