in both games were ported over and merged.

186
00:13:58,780 --> 00:14:01,480
Oh, that's why my
dual-wielding skill's gone.

187
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:02,800
Not just that.

188
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:05,138
All your items seem to be lost, too.

189
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:10,137
You might want to delete them before the
error detection program finds out about it.

190
00:14:10,220 --> 00:14:11,340
Yeah, I better.

191
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:31,622
Okay, what am I going to
do about my skill level?

192
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:33,211
