193
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:38,157
Well, no one except the Game Master, and
as long as he doesn't, you should be okay.

194
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,420
Oh, awesome.

195
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:42,700
Huh, I guess I'm not a beater anymore.

196
