player support program.

200
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:56,702
In the world of the game,
I'm a navigation pixie.

201
00:14:59,040 --> 00:14:59,870
Hey!

202
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,038
This is what I look like as a pixie.

203
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:11,490
Whoa.

204
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,640
No, Daddy, that's annoying.

205
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:17,300
You had admin privileges in SAO.

206
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,913
Do you still have them?

207
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,450
No,

208
00:15:20,533 --> 00:15:22,457
the system will only
allow me to access the

209
00:15:22,540 --> 00:15:25,011
wide area maps and the reference database.

210
00:15:25,620 --> 00:15:26,450
Oh.

211
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:28,340
Listen, Yui.

212
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:34,300
I think your mommy might be stuck
in here somewhere. Mommy? Really?

213
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,306
What do you mean she's stuck?

214
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:41,560
After SAO was cleared, Asuna
never woke up in the real world.

215
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:44,480
I found out she was seen in Alfheim.

216
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:47,565
There's a picture, but
it's too blurry to tell.

217
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,420
What are we going to do?

218
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:52,640
Well, I got a pretty good
idea where she might be.

219
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:55,216
It's something called the World Tree.

220
00:15:55,740 --> 00:15:57,152
I think it's over there.

221
00:15:58,060 --> 00:15:59,820
Mommy's there? Really?

222
00:16:05,020 --> 00:16:06,080
Hang on a second.

223
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:10,257
I was supposed to start the game
in a town in Spriggan territory.

224
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:13,340
So how come I ended up here
in this forest instead?

225
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:14,700
I don't know.

226
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:17,498
Your location data may be corrupted.

227
00:16:17,620 --> 00:16:19,914
Or perhaps there was some interference?

228
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:20,990
Either way,

229
00:16:21,073 --> 00:16:24,837
it would have been nice if the game dropped
me a little closer to the world tree.

230
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,180
Well, let's go.

231
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,580
Wow, these are my wings, huh?

232
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,433
How do I fly with them?

233
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:36,092
You have to access your controller first.

234
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:40,986
Raise your left hand, then position your
fingers like you're grabbing something.

235
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:47,339
Pull it toward yourself to elevate.

236
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:48,912
Push it away to descend.

237
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:51,620
and move it left or right to turn.

238
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:52,770
Okay.

239
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:58,719
Hold down the button to accelerate.

240
00:16:58,820 --> 00:17:01,349
To decelerate, just
ease up on it a little.

241
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:08,013
As long as your wings are
shining, you can stay airborne.

242
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:10,720
But you can't fly forever.

243
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,946
After a while, you'll
need to rest your wings.

244
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,520
This is great!

245
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,997
I think I've got it down.

246
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:26,727
Do me a favor, scan the map and
see where the nearest town is.

247
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:29,437
There's one in Sylph
territory, west of here.

248
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:31,108
It's a town called Sylvain.

249
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,495
It's the closest one.

250
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:35,501
