257
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:11,140
Jeez, they never give up.

258
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,360
Okay then.

259
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:15,900
Prepare for battle!

260
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:18,177
What are you doing?

261
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:21,025
