265
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:29,180
Show me how useful you can be.

266
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:03,380
We can win this!

267
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:08,540
Idiot! Don't stop!

268
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:11,540
Hurry!

269
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,640
Recon!

270
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:46,040
Sorry about this.

271
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:47,908
We're on a mission, though.

272
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:51,037
Give up your money and
items, and we'll let you go.

273
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:53,957
What are you acting like such
a gentleman for, Kagemune?

274
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:56,457
Yeah, we haven't fought
a chick in forever.

275
00:19:56,540 --> 00:19:58,011
Come on, let's waste her.

276
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:03,162
Go on, try it, but I'm
taking one of you with me.

277
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:07,077
Whoever's not afraid of dying,
come on, step up and get some.

278
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,513
You're a stubborn girl.

279
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,040
Suit yourself.

280
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:41,380
Damn, gotta work on those landings.

281
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:49,180
What are you doing? Go! Get out of here!

282
00:20:49,780 --> 00:20:53,737
Would someone tell me why three big
guys are fighting one single girl?

283
00:20:53,820 --> 00:20:55,879
That's pretty uncool if you ask me.

284
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:57,080
What did you say?

285
00:20:57,300 --> 00:20:59,980
Better get your ass out
of here, noob. Fast!

286
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:05,760
You asked for it.

287
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,460
Get ready to die!

288
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:19,410
Huh?

289
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,470
See ya.

290
00:21:24,620 --> 00:21:25,450
Excuse me.

291
00:21:26,220 --> 00:21:27,279
Hate to interrupt.

292
00:21:27,580 --> 00:21:29,639
Do you mind if I take care of this?

293
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:32,580
Uh, I guess if you really want to.

294
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:36,777
It's not like they were gonna let
you walk out of here alive anyway.

295
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:38,801
Then sit back and let me at them.

296
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:48,600
Oh, crap. Where'd he go?

297
00:22:02,220 --> 00:22:04,140
Okay, who's next?

298
00:22:08,780 --> 00:22:11,360
I'm going to raise my hand.

299
00:22:12,780 --> 00:22:13,610
I'm going to say.

300
00:22:13,693 --> 00:22:14,737
I'm going to say.

301
00:22:14,820 --> 00:22:18,340
I'm going to pray.

302
00:22:21,560 --> 00:22:23,140
I love you.

303
00:22:48,340 --> 00:22:55,120
It's too late for now, I don't have
to answer any questions or questions.

304
00:23:35,740 --> 00:23:38,500
Next time, Captive Queen.
